msgstr "Autorización de un solo color iPad: SwiftUI ColorPicker escribe un solo HSV triple en el comando Color: de los accesorios activos."

msgid "iPad waypoint path editor: a touch Canvas that draws Bezier (line / quadratic / cubic) waypoint paths plus path presets, writing the same Path: command desktop's Effect Assist reads."
